# GRAEY competition RFD profile, ArduSub 4.7 parameter names.
#
# Crusader parity: the shared radio carries bounded companion application
# TUNNEL traffic, not a second copy of full autopilot telemetry.  QGC and FCU
# telemetry remain on WiFi/tether.  MAVLink routing and the autopilot's fixed
# heartbeat are not disabled by setting these generated stream groups to zero.
# Apply only with GRAEY killed/disarmed. System 3 is the approved GRAEY Cube
# identity; companion radio application remains system 43.
# Reboot the Cube once to clear runtime message intervals.
SYSID_THISMAV 3
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL1_BAUD 115
BRD_SER1_RTSCTS 0
# Minimal QGC display on the shared RFD: 1 Hz attitude, position and status.
# Raw sensors, RC feedback and the other broad groups remain disabled.
MAV2_EXTRA1 1
MAV2_EXTRA2 0
MAV2_EXTRA3 0
MAV2_POSITION 1
MAV2_RAW_SENS 0
MAV2_RC_CHAN 0
MAV2_EXT_STAT 1

